{"seq":41,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a2684"},"reason":"Body no longer calls Goodall the first to name her study animals; it says this was new in Western science, while Japanese primatologists had named macaques since the early 1950s. Notes explain the card's framing. Spans of all facts realigned after the edit.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jane_Goodall"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hundredth_monkey_effect"},{"url":"https://www.famousscientists.org/jane-goodall/"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",212],["-","was"],["+","gave"],["=",1],["-","the first to give "],["=",22],["-","to"],["+","described"],["=",1],["-","describe "],["=",4],["-","personality."],["+","personality;"],["=",1],["+","in Western science this was new, although Japanese primatologists had been naming the macaques they studied since the early 1950s. "],["=",631]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",206],["-","als Erste "],["=",26],["-","einzelnen."],["+","einzelnen;"],["=",1],["+","in der westlichen Forschung war das neu, japanische Primatologen benannten die von ihnen beobachteten Makaken allerdings schon seit Anfang der 1950er-Jahre. "],["=",587]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",190],["-","первой стала "],["=",4],["+","стала "],["=",26],["-","каждого."],["+","каждого;"],["=",1],["+","для западной науки это было в новинку, хотя японские приматологи давали имена изучаемым макакам ещё с начала 1950-х годов. "],["=",579]]},{"field":"notesEn","diff":[["-","'The"],["+","The"],["=",1],["+","card asked who was 'the "],["=",8],["-","animals"],["+","animals;"],["=",1],["+","strictly that "],["=",2],["+","not so – Japanese primatologists named individual macaques from "],["=",2],["-","card's"],["+","early"],["=",1],["-","framing;"],["+","1950s"],["=",1],["-","numbering"],["+","(e.g."],["=",1],["-","was"],["+","Imo"],["=",1],["-","then"],["+","on"],["=",1],["-","near-universal."],["+","Koshima, 1953) – so t